# Engagement working directories created by the skill at run time: these contain
# real target artifacts, extracted secrets, and evidence from an actual audit.
# Never commit an engagement's output to this (or any) repo.
engagement-*/

# Exception: the one demo engagement committed on purpose, as real evidence for
# examples/steps-to-reproduce.md. It's a synthetic fixture authored for this repo,
# not a real target, so none of the "never commit this" reasoning above applies to it.
!examples/fixtures/vulnbank-demo/engagement-vulnbank-demo/

